{"format":1,"key":"subzone:cleft","path":"/lore/subzone/cleft","name":"Cleft","kind":"subzone","label":"Place","zone":{"key":"teldrassil","name":"Teldrassil","path":"/lore/zone/teldrassil"},"levels":"","description":"Gnarlpine furbolgs ambush travelers in the Cleft, northwest of Dolanaar.","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"subzone:cleft","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["Gnarlpine furbolgs ambush travelers in the Cleft, northwest of Dolanaar.","The Cleft lies off the road between Dolanaar and Darnassus, where Gnarlpine furbolgs have made their den. Teldrassil’s spreading corruption has driven them mad, and they have fortified the hollow. From there, they threaten travelers on the main road and risk cutting Dolanaar off from Darnassus."],"hash":"06654c","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"f8b7cbaeb7","sec":22},"female-narrator":{"sha":"b10e913da5","sec":23}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Cleft","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Cleft"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/quest/487-the-road-to-darnassus","n":"The Road to Darnassus","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/npc/moon-priestess-amara","n":"Moon Priestess Amara","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/topic/furbolg","n":"Furbolg","k":"topic"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/dolanaar","n":"Dolanaar","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/teldrassil","n":"Teldrassil","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/topic/druid","n":"Druid","k":"topic"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/cleft-of-shadow","n":"Cleft of Shadow","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/quest/98403-twisted-hatred","n":"Twisted Hatred","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/npc/cazul","n":"Cazul","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/quest/5729-hidden-enemies","n":"Hidden Enemies","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1858-the-shattered-hand","n":"The Shattered Hand","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1859-therzok","n":"Therzok","k":"quest"}]}
